&#34;a wonderful job on all fronts in organizing my day and time. The UI is very crafty, simple, and elegant and I have used it more than the reminders app on Apples OS. Thanks to the developers for developing such a useful app for its users.&#34;

-previous review.

This premium monthly pricing for this app is an abomination on top of that yearly charge of 23.99 for some added color and unlimited any.do isn&#39;t worth. Worse update of the year...

When I first downloaded it, it said Today, Tomorrow, Upcoming and Someday.

When I updated it, it all changed.

The tab &#34;today&#34; changed into &#34; the name of this folder is today&#34;

Also the tab &#34;tomorrow&#34; changed into &#34;the name of this folder is tomorrow&#34;

Please: Any.do fix this quickly

Thanks,

Function is simple just like the design. I love using it. I have tried many list making apps. This one doesn&#39;t try to do too much but has a lot of features for power users. 
 Would love of they added location based features. &#34;Like remind me to buy AAAbateries when I am at target&#34;

I like that it also will show me my iCal events

I wish I could change the order of the tasks by dragging them, the way one moves apps around the home page on the iPhone. Also, if one&#39;s tasks haven&#39;t been completed by the end of the day, it would be cool to be notified and asked if they should be reclassified under &#34;tomorrow&#34; or &#34;someday.&#34; 
Finally, there should be an &#34;undo&#34; button in case you accidentally cross something off. 

Other than that, thanks for the app!

Such a clear design. Being a person who needs reminders, it does them so well. I love how it separates levels of importance. My favorite part is how it pops up around 10 every morning and says, &#34;Take a moment to plan your day.&#34; 
I always need that.
It&#39;s the perfect app.
